== Description ==

This plugin is used by Glofox customer to easily display their class timetable and memberships. 

With this plugin all you need to do is enter your Branch Id in the settings and then use the supplied shortcodes.

Glofox is simple to use powerful software. From managing memberships, tracking attendances, to selling appointments courses and products, Glofox has you covered - all the while on the go. Anytime, anywhere. With your integrated timetable and membership iframes your members can book and pay for services instantly!

== Installation ==


1. Install the plugin through Wordpress
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Go to Glofox in the Wordpress sidemenu and enter your Branch Id
4. Add the shortcodes to the required pages:
	Timetable: [glofox-timetable]
	Memberships: [glofox-membership]

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= What if I'm not Glofox customer? =

Visit www.glofox.com to become a customer.


